* generic_res.lib - generic linear resistor model with temperature
* coefficients. AUTHORED (not derived from any vendor file). Trivial
* disposable test-fixture model, not a specific vendor part.
*
* USAGE (verified against ngspice 47):
*   .include models/resistors/generic_res.lib
*   R1 n1 n2 <value> RGEN          ; positional form (value then model)
*   R1 n1 n2 RGEN R=<value>        ; equivalent named-parameter form
*
* R(T) = R0 * (1 + TC1*(T-TNOM) + TC2*(T-TNOM)^2)

.model RGEN R (TC1=1e-3 TC2=0 TNOM=27)
